]As a parent of three and a former[ cam]per,[ camp] counselor, and[ camp] director, I cannot impress upon parents enough the meaningful[ impact] summer[ camp] can have on children. In my parent education classes, I often[ refer] to sleep[away camp] as the single most important and[ impact]ful experience a parent can[ provide] their child. For most children, sleep[away camp] develops the skills and mindsets parents so earnestly want to impart upon their children and does so in ways that we parents are sometimes unable to do. So why am I such a passionate advocate for sleep[away camp]?
